## Building Instructions on Linux Host PC ##

1. Recommanded OS: 
Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64bit only)

2. Installation of required tools and libraries:
$ sudo apt-get install gawk wget git-core diffstat unzip texinfo gcc-multilib \
build-essential chrpath socat cpio python3 python3-pip python3-pexpect \
xz-utils debianutils iputils-ping python3-git python3-jinja2 libegl1-mesa \
libsdl1.2-dev pylint3 xterm libarchive-zip-perl

3. Using build script:
This script only build image of rcar-image-adas for MACHINE of raptor
$ cd ${WORK}
$ ./build_yocto_v3p18.sh


